      107        sr-izmerenia.sr-relative-err-water AT ROW 13.91 COL 61.6 COLON-ALIGNED WIDGET-ID 102
      108             VIEW-AS FILL-IN
      109             SIZE 26 BY 1
      110        sr-izmerenia.sr-temperature AT ROW 16.05 COL 5.6 WIDGET-ID 106
      111             VIEW-AS TOGGLE-BOX
      112             SIZE 20 BY .81
      113        sr-izmerenia.sr-abs-err-temp-vol AT ROW 17.19 COL 61.6 COLON-ALIGNED WIDGET-ID 86
      114             VIEW-AS FILL-IN
      115             SIZE 26 BY 1
      116        sr-izmerenia.sr-abs-err-temp-dens AT ROW 18.43 COL 61.6 COLON-ALIGNED WIDGET-ID 84
      117             VIEW-AS FILL-IN
